WEBVTT

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:06.180
Priest duties for this operation will be
performed by former airman Haruto Okonogi,

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.850
High Steward in the Department of
Divinities, as well as...

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.270
Ahem!

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.150
...Natsume Misumi.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.610
You were assigned a seat.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.650
Ah, yes. But I wanted to sit next to Haru.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.700
Huh?

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.070
I like Haru.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.330
Shall we continue?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.380
Yes, ma'am. Um...

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.380
The trickiest part of the Ritual will be

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.970
getting Lord Mitatsu to roll over
on Fushido.

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.050
That girl's something else.

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:46.220
She's so young.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:50.100
Couldn't guess Airman 1st Class
Okonogi was in the priesthood.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.680
Those two are
childhood friends, right?

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:55.770
Yeah, but she's too suspicious!

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.980
You think so too, right, Amakasu?

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:00.320
Uh-huh...

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.940
Is there something wrong, Hisone?

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:06.530
Oh, no, it's just that I've never
met someone like her,

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.740
Well, there's no one like that
in the Air Self-Defense Force.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.330
That's true. Hmm?

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:15.210
Flight Leader Kakiyasu,

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:20.130
if it's okay, I would like to opt out
of doing the base tour.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.590
I understand.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:23.090
I'll take them around instead.

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:24.550
Haru...

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:26.840
Amakasu!

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.100
See ya later.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.390
Will you go with me somewhere?

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.520
Y-Yeah!

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:38.440
It's the hoist launcher
needed for the next training.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.480
Masotan's new equipment, right?

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:44.190
No, I'm having difficulty with it 'cause
it was machinery from 70 years ago...

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:47.450
Seventy years ago?

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:51.950
What the heck is that?

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:45.360
All the existing risk management
measures for the Ritual

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:47.070
are summarized in that report.

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:50.280
But something crucial has been left out.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:54.450
I wanted to speak with you on that point
before adding it in, Ms. Hinomoto.

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:56.410
What is this crucial information?

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.160
Anastomosis.

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:01.830
Masotan!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.080
Thanks for today.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:09.920
The pylon adjustments went well
because of you.

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.720
Recently, I've been feeling
pretty good for some reason.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:16.640
Your conformity is going well.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:19.850
But now, we'll need to be careful about
the anastomosis.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:21.480
What's anastomosis?

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.560
-Oh! No, I mean...
-Excuse me.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.610
What is his name?

00:04:26.690 --> 00:04:27.520
Natsume?

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.780
Natsume! Didn't I tell you
not to go wandering around?

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:35.200
I want to know his name.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.450
Jeez!

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:40.160
Um, his name is Masotan.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.660
Masotan. What a weird name.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:46.880
Masotan gets anxious around people,
he doesn't like being touched...

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:54.470
Is there a problem?

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.600
Not really. Rather, the lack of problems
is more the problem.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:02.810
Um, did I do something to Natsume?

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:04.980
Huh? I don't think so.

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:07.520
But she only stares at me

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.190
with her super intense glare.

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:12.150
She's always been like that.

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:16.530
She doesn't lie, or rather
she's just a blunt person.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.620
There's nothing that you did personally.

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:22.450
Well then! I will be leaving.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:24.830
Huh? Amakasu?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.420
There must be much
for you two to talk about.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.300
You young ones can take your time!

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.340
Young ones?

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:42.600
Here, F-15 and F-2
will maintain a hovering position,

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:45.940
U-Um, excuse me,
but why are you next to me?

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:48.560
What's the nature
of your relationship with Haru?

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:51.900
What? W-We're just comrades.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.440
What is a normal comrade?

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:57.740
Does Haru have other special comrades?

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:01.490
What's with that outfit?

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:03.330
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.910
Viet Cong ramen for lunch today?

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.420
I might smell afterwards, won't I?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:11.750
Does that mean
you've abandoned your femininity?

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.760
Doesn't this one work better?

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:19.550
Why did you eat that if you were worried
about your breath in the first place?

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.640
-E-Excuse me!
-Hmm?

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:24.020
I've been wondering
about this for a while.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:27.810
Why are you so strict with me?

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:31.440
Oh, I'm only saying what I think.

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:33.940
I see.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.570
So that's all it is!

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.820
I totally understand!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:41.740
I always end up saying
whatever pops into my head!

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:44.200
Then I hurt people's feelings
and feel depressed after.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.700
Oh, I don't think
I'm doing anything wrong.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.920
And you reek of garlic,
so please don't come close.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:52.750
Ah, cola!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.880
Haru isn't a morning person,
so he always drank one before school.

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:00.890
He said he couldn't wake up without it.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.510
And on the days he didn't have one,
he'd be super late.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.600
But Okonogi is an early bird now.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:12.360
He wakes up earlier than anyone
and calls roll in a loud voice.

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:16.360
But now that I think about it, that must
be why he's always got bed hair.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:21.450
Actually, I can barely
keep myself from laughing.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:30.540
Did I do it again?

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.710
So, what are you doing cowering in here?

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:38.760
Right now, I need a shell.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:42.550
Snails without shells don't stand
a chance against high school girls.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.100
I'm gonna pour salt on you!

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:46.850
She has become quite attached to you.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:49.060
Aren't you mistaking it
as her picking a fight?

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:53.060
Either way, who cares
about what that brat says!

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:57.690
But what Natsume says is very wholesome.

00:07:58.070 --> 00:08:01.450
In that case, I don't think
she means any harm.

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:03.030
Surely she's not a bad person.

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:06.160
How masochistic!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:09.660
Dammit, your passivity is gonna
get you killed someday.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:10.830
Yes! That's fine!

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.830
Wait... I'm destined... to be killed?

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.590
Well, you did go out with Okonogi alone.

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:22.760
If that chick gets wind of that,
she's gonna murder--

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.510
How do you know that, Nao?

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:31.140
-They went to see a movie together.
-It's the first time I've heard of it,

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:34.810
but I also think Hisone
is driving at full speed into hell.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.360
Right?

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:39.070
Everyone else, too? Why do you think that?

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.820
You're closest to him.

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.740
Closest to who?

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:45.660
You and Okonogi, of course.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:48.330
But aren't you and I close, Nao?

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.830
We've never gone to the movies together!

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.330
Okay then, let's go, let's go!

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:57.590
The next session is do or die,
and that's an understatement.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.470
I and Okonogi?

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:06.180
I wonder why I feel so...

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.720
happy!

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:12.930
I've always wanted this!
To be acknowledged by others...

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:15.140
as a friend!

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:18.560
How many times must I repeat myself,
Technical Sergeant Amakasu?

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:21.900
Get closer to the target, goddamit!

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:27.490
I can't! I can't!

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.420
-<i>You freaking blockhead!</i>
-Eek!

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.630
-This is...
-<i>Like an unwinnable video game.</i>

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.430
<i>There's no way we can do this.</i>

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:52.430
Cutting the sacred Shimenawa rope
that ties Lord Mitatsu's two tails.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:57.440
If it cannot be done in one go,
the rolling will be unsuccessful.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:01.610
Be that as it may...
It won't be easy.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:05.990
The priest and those miko will
physically be there, too.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:10.410
Speaking of the shrine maidens,
have you told them about the key girl?

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:11.950
No.

00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:15.790
I don't believe it's a good idea
to tell them at this point.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.120
Yeah.

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.080
Oh my God.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:22.630
We'll die if we keep going.

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:24.840
This is too much for the first day!

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:34.560
Natsume is really amazing.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.560
Yeah. She's the prettiest, too.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:39.400
I'm not sure about
the whole "Haru" thing.

00:10:40.350 --> 00:10:42.480
She'll definitely be the key girl.

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:46.110
Why are you all resting?

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.490
We need to do this right.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.450
One more time from the top!

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.620
Okay!

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.920
Oh, Sada!

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:45.960
Does it take you back?

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:49.630
Those girls shine, don't they?

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:53.760
I feel a stab in my heart just thinking
of what's to come.

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:57.640
It's their sacred duty,
to ring their bells every day

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.810
and keep dancing.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:03.270
Then one girl will be chosen.

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:06.730
Let's find another place to talk.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:13.360
You still shine, too.

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:18.370
<i>Hiso Maso!</i>

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:24.790
Masotan?

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.590
Masotan!

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.840
Oh, Masotan!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:37.180
After training Masotan
time is always best!

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:40.020
I'm sorry, Masotan.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:43.270
It doesn't seem like I can
visit much for a while.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:48.770
What if I'm seen in the same place
as Okonogi?

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:52.320
I don't wanna die! Masotan!

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.740
Ms. Hinomoto's training
takes a mental toll on us, too.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:03.330
All we did was fail.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.630
Seriously! You girls are great!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.710
You're different than I pictured.

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:11.210
The image that miko
are holy and sacred is an illusion.

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:14.090
Only the Dragon Pilots
can't get boyfriends.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:18.640
The men think
Technical Sergeant Hitomi is--

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:20.140
Is that right?

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.770
Let's go for a drink now.

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:24.100
We can have a welcome party for you!

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:26.850
Jeez. I wish they'd get lost fast.

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:29.190
They're clearly on cloud nine.

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:31.940
Hey, they're underage.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.320
What's up with you, Zaito?

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:36.110
Suddenly you're so serious.

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.240
I'm always serious.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.580
Hey, let's take a pic together.

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.000
Take the picture,
but then go home and sleep.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.210
Huh?

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.460
I can't get us both in.

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.500
Ah, jeez. Give it here.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.220
Uh, sorry.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:56.800
What about the pic?

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:59.850
Hey, hold on a sec!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.180
Wait, Hoshino!

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:07.520
-It just looked bad.
-Why are you explaining yourself to me?

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:08.600
Well, 'cause...

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:10.900
You and I are just associates.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:14.320
If you wanna cozy up to high school girls
and flirt around,

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:15.780
that's got nothing to do with--

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.410
Hoshino!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.920
Y-You're the worst!

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:37.300
-Unbelievable!
-It wasn't on purpose--

00:14:37.590 --> 00:14:39.010
Don't you ever come near me!

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.260
You creepy, lecherous perv! Lecher!

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:42.850
You're a brute!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:48.980
Seriously.

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.530
Seriously?

00:14:57.150 --> 00:14:58.030
Okay.

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.280
Haru!

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.450
Haru?

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.210
Hey you, have you seen Haru--

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:12.250
Huh?

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:21.680
<i>Haru has the same one.</i>

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:30.020
Huh? Natsume?

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:35.570
Natsume!

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:41.280
Natsume!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:44.280
Um...

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:46.080
I'm very sorry!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.450
Huh?

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.210
Probably no, definitely,

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:53.460
I did something
to create a misunderstanding!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.710
I was in the hangar to "lick, lick, lick."

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.090
"Lick, lick, lick" is

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:01.220
a way for me to interact with Masotan.

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:04.970
Anyway, I wasn't there to lick Okonogi.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:07.100
I would never do that!

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:11.310
I like Haru.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:12.560
Huh?

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:15.190
I love him.

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:18.320
Ever since I discovered my feelings,

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:20.320
I've always, truly,
and properly loved him.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.070
That's why I can't forgive you.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:28.040
You think we're the same because
we're blunt, but we are not at all alike.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:29.660
You lie all the time!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:33.580
No, I haven't lied!
I really don't have a filter!

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.330
Then say it.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:38.170
-I really don't have a filter!
-Not that.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:42.380
Tell me that you like Haru.

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.840
Say it!

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:46.390
Like?

00:16:47.300 --> 00:16:49.890
I... like Okonogi?

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:54.650
No, no. What are you saying?

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:58.610
To think that I like Okonogi?
I mean, I don't hate him.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.400
I think his bedhead is cute.

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:03.700
I like the freshness of his voice
as if he just finished puberty,

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:05.660
I have to say
I enjoy hearing it.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:09.410
Oh yeah! And how he smokes
to make up for his baby face,

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:12.620
or how he stoops like a cat,
but he actually likes dogs,

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.670
and his eyes always droop,
so, he looks tired.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.080
There's plenty to like about him.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:21.260
But it's not in the way that you think.

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.340
Yeah, it's completely different!

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.340
-It's the same.
-Huh?

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:28.640
All of that means you like him.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:43.530
Hold...

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:44.900
Hold on.

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.670
No! No!

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.750
The reason I've been feeling uneasy...

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:07.340
was because I have feelings for Okonogi!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:11.390
The more I think about it,
the more sense it makes.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:14.520
Which means that I really,

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:17.230
that towards Okonogi, I am...

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:21.610
My feelings for Okonogi are...

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:49.300
Plop.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.730
We will soon begin the joint training.

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:04.820
Board your aircraft!

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:09.610
<i>Amakasu!</i>

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.120
Fly as usual and you'll be fine.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:15.160
-<i>If you need anything, use the wireless--</i>
-Masotan!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:17.450
<i>Swallow me up quickly!</i>

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.120
Amakasu?

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.590
<i>Serpent, taxi. Runway 28.</i>

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:29.130
Let's go, Masotan.

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.810
What's wrong, Masotan? Let's get moving.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:36.640
<i>It's okay to fly now.</i>

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:38.390
Amakasu?

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.770
<i>This is Penguin! I've got an emergency!</i>

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:47.360
<i>The suit is starting to melt!</i>

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:49.240
All of you, what's your status?

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:51.700
Morris here, no problem.

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:53.410
Same for Jimmy.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:55.990
Hisone is in trouble!

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:57.700
That's not possible!

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:01.540
These are the most updated suits
based upon data taken from past flights.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:03.790
The suits should be durable
for much longer!

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:09.090
<i>The training is now suspended. All pilots</i>
<i>must forcibly eject from their OTF!</i>

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:13.340
<i>Did you hear me?</i>
<i>Withdraw from your OTF immediately!</i>

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.050
<i>Yes, ma'am.</i>

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:16.140
<i>Copy.</i>

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:17.890
Masotan!

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:25.020
Amakasu!

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:26.110
Amakasu?

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:27.150
Hoshino!

00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:59.350
Spray them with the medicine quickly!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:01.810
<i>Neutralize the gastric acid</i>
<i>on their bodies!</i>

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:03.060
Spray!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:12.400
It seems that we were too late.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:14.910
My apologies.

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:16.110
Amakasu!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:17.410
Amakasu!

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:20.080
Are you okay?

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.500
Why?

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:24.790
Amakasu.

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:26.670
Masotan.

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:29.800
Masotan said he was in pain.

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:31.460
Then...

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:33.840
Anastomosis has taken place.

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:40.890
When there's an emotional change in
a pilot who is well-aligned with her OTF,

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:43.560
that is when anastomosis occurs.

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.270
Anastomosis?

00:21:46.730 --> 00:21:48.100
So that was it.

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:51.690
In that case, I can see why
the suits melted.

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:53.740
Anastomosis, in layman's terms,

00:21:54.440 --> 00:21:59.160
is the OTF proactively trying
to digest you.

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:00.740
Digest?

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.540
So in other words,

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:06.120
they're eating the pilot?

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:09.790
Oh no.
Why all of a sudden?

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:13.920
If it's bad or not,
it depends on the pilot's belief.

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:17.930
In brief, the Organic Transformed Fliers
are trying to eat them 'cause...

00:22:18.510 --> 00:22:23.970
Hisone and El have certain emotions
that we don't have?

00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:26.270
That's one way of putting it.

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:28.270
You two...

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:30.440
fell in love, didn't you?

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:33.440
You...

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:35.940
are in love.

00:22:36.280 --> 00:22:38.950
TO BE CONTINUED

00:24:09.700 --> 00:24:11.290
<i>-He's kind.</i>
<i>-Are you stupid?</i>

00:24:11.370 --> 00:24:13.120
<i>-He's kind.</i>
<i>-Are you stupid?</i>

00:24:13.250 --> 00:24:15.040
<i>-He's is really kind.</i>
<i>-Huh?</i>

00:24:15.380 --> 00:24:18.210
<i>-It's so stupid.</i>
<i>-He's so kind and sweet.</i>

00:24:18.420 --> 00:24:20.220
<i>I miss Amakasu.</i>

00:24:21.170 --> 00:24:22.220
<i>I'm sorry.</i>
